#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
NORA V5.7.2 Knowledge Graph Exporter

Builds an evidence-aware, browser-ready graph from the existing V5.7.2 CSV
artifacts without changing the V5.7.2 analytics pipeline.

Graph contract
--------------
Context Family -> Context Pattern -> Context Leaf -> Interaction (optional)
with independent semantic layers for Participant, Entity, Context Fact, Tool,
Root Cause, Remediation, Relation Motif, Evidence and grounded relations.

Two edge kinds are deliberately kept separate:
- semantic: comes from V5.7.2 grounded_relationships.csv
- aggregation: added only for navigation/containment such as HAS_PATTERN,
  HAS_LEAF, HAS_ENTITY, HAS_PARTICIPANT, etc.

Usage
-----
python nora_v572_graph_builder.py \
  --input-dir nora_v572_out \
  --output-dir nora_v572_graph \
  --include-interactions
"""
